Error: Jet.MissingWorkspaceModule: `workspace.jet` must declare `module workspace { … }`
 Why: `workspace.jet` is the monorepo workspace index; it must contain exactly one `module workspace { members: … }` body
 Fix: Write `module workspace { members: find("./packages") }` in `workspace.jet`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MissingWorkspaceModule
